      <h>2580</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>title=SD02 - Generate and Optimize Grocery List   (UC06, UC07; F07, F08, F09, F12)\nGUI calls reach the facade through MealPlanningApi (HTTP, as in SD01), the CLI calls it in-process
obj=Meal Planner~U ACTOR
obj=:MealPlanningGUI~GUI
obj=:MealPlanningFacade~F
obj=:MealPlanService~MPS
obj=:PantryService~PS
obj=:GroceryService~GS
obj=pantry:Pantry~P
obj=prices:\nPriceDataSource~PDS
obj=:GroceryListRepository~GLR
obj=:BudgetService~BS
obj=:AgentController~AC
obj=:MealPlanningAgent~AG
obj=:ToolManager~TM
obj=:SubstitutionTool~SUB
obj=:IngredientRepository~IR
obj=:ProviderLLMAdapter\n«LLMClient»~LLM
obj=:ConstraintValidator~CV

U-&gt;&gt;&gt;GUI : 1: Generate grocery list
GUI-&gt;&gt;&gt;F : 2: generateOptimizedGroceryList(\nplanId); on=F
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;MPS : 3: getPlan(planId); on=MPS
MPS.&gt;F : 4: plan; off=MPS
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;PS : 5: getPantry(profileId); on=PS
PS.&gt;F : 6: pantry; off=PS
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;GS : 7: generateList(plan, pantry); on=GS
combinedFragment=loop~L1 GS P; P:[each IngredientRequirement of each PlannedMeal]
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;P : 8: availableQuantity(\ningredient, date); on=P
P.&gt;GS : 9: usable Quantity (expired\nstock excluded); off=P
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;GS + : 10:\ntoBuy = required\n- available
tick=1
--=L1
text=GS:incompatible units stop the\naffected item and request a fix
GS.&gt;F : 11: GroceryList (shortages only); off=GS
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;GS : 12: optimizeList(list); on=GS
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;GS + : 13:\nconsolidate(\nitems)
tick=1
combinedFragment=loop~L2 GS PDS; P:[each GroceryItem with toBuy &gt; 0]
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PDS : 14: estimatePrice(ingredient, toBuy); on=PDS
PDS.&gt;GS : 15: price, or none (partial estimate); off=PDS
--=L2
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;GLR : 16: save(list)
GS.&gt;F : 17: optimized GroceryList; off=GS
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;BS : 18: evaluate(list, weeklyBudget); on=BS
BS.&gt;F : 19: BudgetStatus (estimate, shortfall, costDrivers); off=BS
combinedFragment=alt~A GUI CV; F:[status.withinBudget]
F.&gt;GUI : 20: AgentResponse(SUCCESS,\nlist, status)
..=A; F:[over budget: UC07 extends UC06]
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC : 21: resolveBudgetConflict(plan, status); on=AC
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AG : 22: proposeSubstitution(\ncontext, costDrivers); on=AG
combinedFragment=loop~T AG LLM; TM:[step &lt;= maxToolSteps and no final PlanChange yet]
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;LLM : 23: generateStructured(prompt, NextAction-or-PlanChange schema); on=LLM
LLM.&gt;AG : 24: tool call, or final PlanChange; off=LLM
combinedFragment=alt~D AG LLM; TM:[valid tool call: substitution(ingredient)]
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 25: isValidCall(toolName,\nargs); on=TM
TM.&gt;AG : 26: true; off=TM
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 27: execute(toolName, args); on=TM
TM-&gt;&gt;&gt;SUB : 28: execute(args); on=SUB
SUB-&gt;&gt;&gt;SUB + : 29:\nfindCandidates(\ntarget,context)
tick=1
SUB-&gt;&gt;&gt;IR : 30: findSubstitutes(\ningredient); on=IR
IR.&gt;SUB : 31: candidate ingredients; off=IR
SUB.&gt;TM : 32: ToolResult(candidates); off=SUB
TM.&gt;AG : 33: ToolResult; off=TM
..=D; TM:[final PlanChange with cheaper substitutions]
text=AG:loop ends
--=D
--=T
AG.&gt;AC : 34: PlanChange; off=AG
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;CV : 35: validateChange(change, context); on=CV
CV.&gt;AC : 36: ValidationResult (restrictions, time, recalculated cost); off=CV
AC.&gt;F : 37: AgentResponse(NEEDS_CONFIRMATION, change); off=AC
F.&gt;GUI : 38: list, BudgetStatus,\ncheaper alternatives to\npreview
text=GUI:on confirmation the change is\napplied\nas in SD03 (confirmChange),\nthe list is\nthen recalculated, never\nassumed compliant
--=A
off=F
GUI.&gt;U : 39: grocery list with estimate\nand warnings</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
  </element>
</diagram>
